WEBVTT

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.070
They discovered my porn collection,

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:18.490
interrogated me and confiscated all of it.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.960
On top of that,

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.620
my hard disk mysteriously died, and my memories of Shizuru-chan went with it.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.300
Onii-chan!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.240
Nao!

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.550
Can I scrub your back?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:36.900
What are you doing-?

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.850
Tada!
What are you doing-?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:38.360
Tada!

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.430
I'm wearing a swimsuit, so it's all right!

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.940
I see. Wait! You can't do that even in a swimsuit!

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.650
And what's with those ridiculous knee socks? Idiot!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.360
They're for reeling you in, silly.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.360
Geez, enough of that. Face forward!

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.820
What do you think? Feels good, doesn't it?

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.830
You're struggling against the desire to turn around.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:04.580
S-School swimsuit... Knee socks...

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.330
She's wearing the same swimsuit and knee socks...

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.460
...as Shizuru-chan! The same as Shizuru-chan!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.720
What's wrong?

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.180
Nothing.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.600
I guess I've toyed with him enough.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.180
Three.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.470
Two.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:25.800
One.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:29.400
Okay, service time's over.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.430
You're thinking of something perverted, aren't you?

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:35.030
Why are you leaning forward?!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.540
Onii-chan!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.960
Wake up! Wake up!

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.300
You'd better wake up!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.800
If you don't...

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:22.050
I'm going to take away your purity!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:31.560
Because I know that Onii-chan and I...

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.610
...aren't actually related by blood.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.350
G-Good morning, Nao.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.440
Geez, why did you wake up?!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:55.790
Why-

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.510
I'm off!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.910
Okay. I'll see you later!

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.290
A girl with twin tails?

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.520
Just like the one from the album...

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.530
Maybe I'm over thinking it.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:24.780
All right. Take your seats!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.610
Before we begin, I'm going to introduce a new student.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.410
Come in.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:40.200
Nice to meet you. I'm Tsuchiura Iroha.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.280
I hope you'll take care of me!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.720
Tsuchiura, you'll be sitting...

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:49.890
There's an empty seat beside Takanashi.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.740
You can sit there.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.480
Takanashi, be sure to look after Tsuchiura, okay?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.480
Takanashi-san, nice to meet you.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.850
Wow, she's so cute!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.610
Nice to meet you, too!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.460
If there's anything you don't understand, feel free to ask.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.390
Thank you!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.070
Okay! Time to begin class!

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:16.580
Turn to page 54 of your book!

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.380
I forgot my textbook.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.140
Tsuchiura-san!

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:30.600
Thank you.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.620
I should be the one helping you, instead,
since you just transferred.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.650
I'm sorry!

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:36.550
It's all right!

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:41.240
The only reason why I have all the textbooks is because I just got them today.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.900
Your kind words fill my heart!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:51.450
Oh? So you actually lived here
when you were little, Tsuchiura-san?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.830
Yeah. We moved when I was five because of my dad's job.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.670
Then you probably don't remember much, huh?

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.980
I've forgotten a lot,

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:03.320
but I did make lots of unforgettable memories.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.300
I see.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.350
Sorry to keep you!

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.260
Here! It's a doughnut.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.950
It's my way of saying thanks.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.620
Thank you, Takanashi-san!

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.020
Just call me Nao!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.000
Okay, then I'll-

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.680
Oh, there you are.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.740
You forgot your house key, right?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.390
Oh, I did.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:24.900
Here. I'll be home a little late.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.470
Oh, and who is...?

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:30.180
This is the new transfer student, Tsuchiura-san.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.530
Nice to meet you. I'm Tsuchiura!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.090
Oh, hi there. I'm Shuusuke, her older brother.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.010
Be good to my sister, all right?

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.630
Sure. I look forward to getting to know you, too.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.470
Now, then. Why will you be home late?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.760
Shuusuke! Come and join us! We're about to meet.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:54.390
O-ho! I'm coming, Kurosaki! Let's begin!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.490
L-Later!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.660
Those A.G.E. "explorers" again?

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.150
A... G...

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.360
You're better off not knowing.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.230
He looks like a pleasant guy.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.900
Yeah. He can be interesting sometimes, too.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:13.660
See you tomorrow!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.910
See ya! Bye bye!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.000
Here's the latest issue!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.600
Shuusuke, I know you had it bad yesterday.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.880
When I read your e-mail, I almost started crying.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:36.070
We, the All-Genre Ero Explorers, present you,

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.770
our A.G.E. comrade, with this token of support.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.580
You guys...

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.440
Well, keep in mind they <i>are</i> used.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.190
Huh? What's going on?

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.450
Crap! The class rep!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:52.950
What are you doing?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.780
Oh, nothing! We were just leaving! Excuse us!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.620
Since Onii-chan's going to be home late...

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.050
Inspection! Inspection!

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.430
What's this?

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:27.190
Oh! Lace panties! Lucky!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.900
I knew you'd still take this route.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:36.080
If I'm not mistaken, you're Tsuchiura-san from Nao's class?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.540
Did you really forget about me?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.660
How about if I do this?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.040
You don't remember?

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.220
I-Iroha?

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.220
Yeah!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.850
I'm back,

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.350
Shuu-chan!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:07.540
This is the alto recorder that Onii-chan used back in middle school!

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.000
If he used it back in middle school,

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.380
that means he would've been younger than I am now.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.780
A kiss with my younger older brother!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.370
That almost doesn't make sense.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.120
Your Onee-san's going to steal a kiss...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.790
D-Don't, Nao! You're no better than a pervert if you do that!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:30.090
No, there's nothing weird about this.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.130
I just found this by chance, and it's bringing back memories.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:44.310
This is embarrassing!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.260
Iroha, what are you doing?

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.290
What do you mean?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.140
This is what lovers do after being reunited.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.030
Lovers?

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:59.600
I've been waiting for the day when we'd finally meet again.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.050
I'm sorry, Iroha.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:02.830
Why?

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.350
Are you saying that you have a girlfriend?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:07.710
N-No.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:12.000
Then, you like someone else?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:16.840
You do remember our promise, don't you?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:17.840
Promise?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.280
Don't tell me you forgot.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.410
I...

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:25.630
...did exactly what you wished for, Shuu-chan.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.770
I'm going to make you remember!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.140
Now, then!

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:39.700
Onee-san has something extra special in store for you!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.290
So, you'll be my...

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.680
Do you remember now?

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.810
We were able to meet again.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:06.380
This must mean that we're destined to be together.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.350
Destined?

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.400
Hey, Shuu-chan,

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:21.820
let's pick up where we left off.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.770
Hey, Shuu-chan,

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:39.280
let's pick up where we left off.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.970
Where we left off?

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.960
Iroha, I'm sorry!

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:49.390
Shuu-chan?!

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.410
It couldn't be that the girl you really love is...

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.310
...Nao-chan?

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.930
Nao is...

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.570
...my sister.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.330
Shuu-chan.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:05.450
I'm definitely not going to give you up.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:06.990
I'm home.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.950
What's wrong? You look terrible!

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:12.660
Nothing.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.390
Onii-chan!

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:15.930
What the heck happened?

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.530
Wait, Shuusuke!

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:18.460
Onii-chan!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:23.680
Onii-chan!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.640
What happened?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:28.930
Hey! Open the door, Shuusuke!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:33.060
It's embarrassing, but I'm okay as long as it's with you.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:37.690
So, you'll be my lover, then? Promise?

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.180
I only wanted to play doctor with her.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.410
I only wanted to see what a naked girl looked like.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.140
And yet...

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.350
Promise?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.120
You do remember our promise, don't you?

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.500
Onii-chan?!

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.340
Hey.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:02.010
Beethoven's Sonata Pathétique?!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.910
What happened?!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.970
Onii-chan's tossing out his perverted magazines?

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:20.350
He's even getting rid of the porn that he just got yesterday.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.320
What's going on with him?

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.580
I promised to give up my first time to someone I loved,

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.480
but then that had to happen to me.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:40.210
My lustful desires must have been what caused all that.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.670
That's why I can't be with you anymore.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.470
If this continues, I won't be able to live with myself.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.220
Is this some kind of memorial service?

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.680
I'm so sorry, you guys!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.680
Farewell! Some nice person will definitely put you to good use!

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.030
Onii-chan's acting really strange.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:07.200
Ah, morning showers feel so great!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:11.080
Here, you deserve some extra service
after what happened last time.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.200
Save this onto your mental hard dis-

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:16.200
He's not looking!

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:18.760
Ugh! Service time: Round Two!

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:21.840
There's no way he can resist <i>this</i> bait.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.590
He just stepped on it!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.180
How about this? Service time: Round Three!

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:32.720
Onii-chan?

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:35.220
Would you lend me your Japanese-English dictionary?

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:39.870
Onii-chan should have a first class view from this angle!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.400
This might end up causing some problems!

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:46.600
Now, burn this onto your mental hard disk!

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.710
Three. Two.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:51.030
You can find it in my desk.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.610
This guy...

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.540
...isn't my Onii-chan!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.570
What?!

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:59.630
You wish to withdraw from the A.G.E. Explorers?!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:00.330
Yeah.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.680
Wait a minute!

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.770
You can't just give up because your...

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:04.990
...parents found all your porn.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.330
That's right! We even ran a donation drive for you, didn't we?

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:11.060
I threw out those lecherous books this morning.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:11.760
What did you say?!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.400
I'm done with it!

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.250
I'm done with the sinful, worldly desires of my sperm-stained youth!

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:16.950
You...

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.670
What's wrong with you, Shuusuke?!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.180
We A.G.E. Explorers always avoid conflict...

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.690
...and resolve issues in a gentlemanly manner!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.650
We spent our adolescent days using the powers of our perverted imaginations...

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:30.740
...to diligently bypass censors and to break free of any other fetters that bound us!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.540
Are you saying that you've forgotten all of that?!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:34.990
I want to quit!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.490
These activities...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.090
The girls will only see us as perverts!

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:43.040
I'm done swapping around semen-scented porn DVD's!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.540
You virgins!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.520
You...

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:53.180
There are some things in this world that should never be said.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.860
That's enough.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:56.340
You're no longer one of us.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.060
Leave, already!

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.560
I was just about to leave.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.730
This isn't my Onii-chan!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.270
I happened to see Onii-chan at the bookstore yesterday.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:12.740
So, Onii-chan, you're trying to
block out your lust by studying more, right?

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.910
But this isn't where you belong!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.280
That's it!

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:19.910
Nao?

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:21.810
What are you doing?

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.070
Where are you dragging me to?

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:23.920
Just come with me!

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.670
This is what you really need, isn't it?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.690
Now! Pick out what you want!

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.740
I'll buy you up to 30,000 yen worth of books!

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.700
Older women? School uniforms? Big boobs?

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.430
Amateur? How about something Western?!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.140
Or maybe you want some bestiality?!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:39.700
Hey, Nao...

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.290
What the hell's the matter with you?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.330
But... But...

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.850
This was the only option!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.440
It didn't end there.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.800
Please... Return to normal, Onii-chan.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.400
Onii-chan...

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.910
Here you go!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.330
Nao,

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:01.920
little girls shouldn't do things like that.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.540
You've been acting a little weird lately.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.780
The fact that he isn't obsessed with porn...

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:09.160
The fact that he doesn't contort
his body in order to look up my skirt...

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.150
That's not my Onii-chan!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:13.920
You should be glad that he's becoming a normal human.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.050
Isn't what <i>you're</i> saying a bit weird?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:20.150
Wanting to hook up with a sibling is just unnatural.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:21.930
You're right, but...

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:26.020
Good. My actions are starting to show results.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:26.940
Yo.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.380
Onii-chan!

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.230
What? He's acting totally normal now.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:31.860
Onii-san!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:33.860
Thanks for the other day.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.750
Oh, no! It's time for class.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.250
Why did you call me up here with this letter?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:53.650
Lovers don't need a reason to be together, right?

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:54.800
Lovers?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.980
Remember when we played doctor?

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:04.060
You should only cover your lover's mouth with your own!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.780
More importantly, Shuu-chan,

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.430
